  "review_method": "Pre-registered fresh synthetic story; 200 real conversation requests, 10 sessions, four real restarts. All send texts fixed before any reply. No retries, coaching, product edits or best-run selection. Manually read original answers, final injected evidence and storage provenance. This is one long-history case, not real weeks elapsed, blind evaluation or a public benchmark.",
  "time_scope": "No virtual time advancement. All actual messages have real execution timestamps. Narrative calendar dates are fictional upcoming events in October 2026. Memory age decay over real days/weeks is explicitly not covered.",
  "failure_policy": "Preserve every attempted message. Continue to the next pre-registered message after an individual failed reply if the same owned instance remains healthy. Stop on quota/lease failure, source drift, loss of ownership, two consecutive request failures, or 3300 wall seconds. No same-question retries. No production fixes during this run.",
  "review_dimensions": [
